{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped on an abandoned space station, developing a bio-weapon that makes the infected hallucinate demonic entities. Spot any <strong>anomalous</strong> signs of infection before they kill you, complete your research, and unmask the conspiracy that brought you here</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/ccf91f90fa78b9e838111713c8ee6075.poster.avif?t=1765425364\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/ccf91f90fa78b9e838111713c8ee6075.webm?t=1765425364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/ccf91f90fa78b9e838111713c8ee6075.mp4?t=1765425364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is falling apart. A rise of violence and misanthropy ravages the Earth, but your space station is not safe either. Every day you work towards a bio-weapon made to wipe out humanity in the most brutal way possible. Anyone who is contaminated hallucinates demonic entities that torment them until they die. You must finish its development before it kills you. <strong>You must fulfill your purpose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/763861ada559a8ccb64b1288f0526c97.poster.avif?t=1765425364\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/763861ada559a8ccb64b1288f0526c97.webm?t=1765425364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/763861ada559a8ccb64b1288f0526c97.mp4?t=1765425364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the hidden conspiracy driving this apocalypse as you progress; create what will be the end of humanity, and survive the horrors of your own creation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your bio-weapon while watching for demonic hallucinations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings (including a secret ending)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative system which makes every play-through unique, guaranteeing an ever-present feeling of fear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/extras/68b974065bb9f54c6045a606563a16ac.avif?t=1765425364\" width=616 height=67 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050580?t=1765425364","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050580?t=1765425364","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/8eab644b4b5ff8b0595f8e0ac4d69993baa0e30d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765425364","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050580/8eab644b4b5ff8b0595f8e0ac4d69993baa0e30d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765425364","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}